<title>USA: Technology Solutions forms German unit.</title>
<headline>Technology Solutions forms German unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Solutions Co said Wednesday it would enter the German market through a newly formed subsidiary, TSC Europe (Deutschland) GmbH.</p>
<p>The Cologne-based unit will be operated as part of TSC Europe and will be headed by Susan Dark, who was a senior vice president of TSC Europe.</p>
<p>Technology Solutions develops business and technology consulting services that help clients with their customer relations and improve operations.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
